        "text": "Step 1: Substitute \\(x = 0\\) and \\(y = 0\\) into the given functional equation to find \\(f(0)\\):\n\\[f(0) + f(0) = f(0 + 0) - 0 \\cdot 0 - 1 \\implies 2f(0) = f(0) - 1 \\implies f(0) = -1.\\]"
      },
      {
