        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Substitute \\(y = 1\\) into the original equation:\n\\[f(x) + f(1) = f(x + 1) - x \\cdot 1 - 1 \\implies f(x) + 1 = f(x + 1) - x - 1 \\implies f(x + 1) = f(x) + x + 2.\\]"
