        "text": "Step 5: Find the integers \\(n\\) such that \\(f(n) = n\\):\n\\[\\frac{n^2 + n - 2}{2} = n \\implies n^2 + n - 2 = 2n \\implies n^2 - n - 2 = 0 \\implies (n-2)(n+1) = 0.\\]\nSo, \\(n = 2\\) or \\(n = -1\\)."
